# AI Rules for Haifeng Player

## Build and Install Instructions

When asked to build or install the mobile application, use the following commands to ensure the correct Java 17 environment is used:

```bash
export JAVA_HOME=/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk@17
export PATH=$JAVA_HOME/bin:$PATH
./gradlew :mobile:installDebug
```

Pull logs

```bash
adb logcat --pid=$(adb shell pidof -s com.haifeng) -v time
```

## Project Context
- **Project Name**: Haifeng Player (formerly Nuomi Player)
- **Primary Modules**: 
  - `:mobile`: The main Android application.
  - `:shared`: Shared logic and media service.
  - `:automotive`: Native Android Automotive OS support.
- **Java Version**: OpenJDK 17 is required.
- **Gradle**: Uses Gradle Wrapper (`./gradlew`).
